Mechanism (read, packages/nears_dls/lib/components/nitemcard/n_item_card.dart _rowAddPrice/_discountRowWidths/_RenderRowBody):
  the side-by-side decision is taken at decisionWidth = infoWidth (full info column), the price then renders at
  _inlinePriceWidth(infoWidth, add 44dp); strike width left beside the full-size price < _strikeFloor -> _strikeOrNull == null
  -> singleLine() -> discount pill present -> current price only (NEARS-3903 W2). Width-driven: the rail card width (300dp)
  is unchanged by this fix; the new host height (bottom whitespace visible) is not the limiter.
Test-vs-device: row_card_host_text_scale_test.dart expects the strike drawn for non-in-cart discounted rows at 1.3x (test fonts); device fonts drop it.
